# Day 21

**21km / 5.5 hours**

Another day featuring a town around midday consuming time with shopping. The rest of the walk featured some nice views. It began in deep fog reducing visibility a bit.

![The path with the sunrays shining through the fog](./foggy-path.jpg)

![The clouds in the distance with the ranges in the background](./cloudy-view.jpg)

After that we went through some farmland with some curious lambs watching me walk past.

![The lambs giving me a strange look](./farm-lambs.jpg)

Past this the track joined a beautiful day walk on the cliffs where you could view the coast and the ocean in the distance.

![The rocky coast with a little beach at high tide] (./coast-ocean.jpg)

After a little beach walk it's just into the town which is kinda two towns adjoined so was a decent walk and it was quite a pleasant one.